    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d808">

                <pb facs="0670" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.00/12411.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary Dodge to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 26.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Special Commissioners of the President of
                                the <lb/> United States, near the Mediators</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 3, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith the
                    original of a note dated the 1st instant, received by the Commissioners from the
                    Mediators, together with an English translation of the same which I have made.*
                    * * I also enclose a copy of a note dated today, addressed by the Commissioners
                    to the Mediators in reply to the foregoing.* * * I further enclose a clipping
                    from the New York Times of the 3d instant, in which is given the reply of the
                    Huertista delegates to an identic note of the Mediators addressed to them.* *
                    *</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Percival Dodge</hi></signed>.</closer>




